01:20:56.090 --> 01:20:57.590
It's nothing, kid.

01:20:58.050 --> 01:21:00.000
I feel much younger.

01:21:00.220 --> 01:21:03.360
-Good night, Mr. Crab. -Good night, Bob.

01:21:03.360 --> 01:21:08.000
-Son, turn off the light! -Yes, mom.

01:21:08.000 --> 01:21:13.430
The Camping Episode

01:21:13.430 --> 01:21:25.380
Luckily, the weekend has arrived.

01:21:25.380 --> 01:21:30.000
And it's not just any weekend, but the weekend in which Bob Esponja and Patricio

01:21:30.090 --> 01:21:35.690
You're going camping. Wouldn't it be great if you got lost in the woods and never came back?

01:21:35.690 --> 01:21:38.190
