01:22:50.350 --> 01:22:53.290
But that will never happen!

01:22:53.290 --> 01:22:57.410
I would never spend the whole night with you, you losers!

01:22:57.410 --> 01:22:59.480
So get used to that!

01:23:00.000 --> 01:23:02.500
It's okay. Have fun in there!

01:23:02.500 --> 01:23:06.000
Stop it, Arté! You'll see what camping is!

01:23:06.000 --> 01:23:08.820
Calamardo will come camping with us.

01:23:11.820 --> 01:23:17.210
Now, you'll see how a true man of action does it!

01:23:17.210 --> 01:23:22.660
Here we are. My tent that can be armed alone and with remote control.

01:23:22.660 --> 01:23:25.160
Watch and learn.

01:23:30.770 --> 01:23:34.310
That was great, Squidward, but how do you get in?

01:23:34.310 --> 01:23:36.150
Yeah, it looks all crushed.

01:23:36.150 --> 01:23:38.290
It's not ready yet, you fools.

01:23:42.150 --> 01:23:44.250
- Make the measurement. - Great!

01:23:46.350 --> 01:23:49.050
- It's softening the ground! - Of course!

01:23:52.540 --> 01:23:54.140
Write that down, write that down!

01:23:59.210 --> 01:24:00.000
Voila!

01:24:02.240 --> 01:24:08.830
But what could be compared to being under the stars?

01:24:08.830 --> 01:24:12.050
Yes! Very good! Magnificent! You're the best!

01:24:12.050 --> 01:24:16.470
Well, this effort made me hungry like a big bear in the woods.

01:24:16.470 --> 01:24:22.050
Time to eat something. I guess you two will make a stew of branches and rocks.

01:24:22.050 --> 01:24:25.170
No, we'll eat something even better.

01:24:25.170 --> 01:24:28.390
Malvaviscos!

01:24:32.360 --> 01:24:38.050
Patricio SpongeBob, Patricio SpongeBob, can you catch me, change?

01:24:38.050 --> 01:24:41.060
SpongeBob, Patricio, I catch you, change!

01:24:41.060 --> 01:24:45.880
Patricio SpongeBob, I like to say, change!

01:24:45.880 --> 01:24:49.750
SpongeBob, Patricio, me too!

01:24:54.980 --> 01:24:57.990
SpongeBob, Patricio, here, serve yourself, change!

01:24:57.990 --> 01:25:00.000
Very tasty!

01:25:00.000 --> 01:25:06.390
Patricio Bob Esponja. The deliciousness has already landed.

01:25:06.390 --> 01:25:09.210
As you are astronauts, you can eat malvaviscos.

01:25:09.210 --> 01:25:15.210
I have a can of albondigas de percebes suecas and I'm going to look for my abrelatas.

01:25:15.210 --> 01:25:18.210
But Squidward, you didn't bring an abrelatas when you walked up here.

01:25:18.210 --> 01:25:21.220
Why bother? I'm three meters from my house.

01:25:21.220 --> 01:25:26.220
But this is an open space. The abrelatas doesn't fit with the spirit of the camp.

01:25:26.220 --> 01:25:28.220
It's cheating.

01:25:28.220 --> 01:25:30.000
Okay, okay.

01:25:30.000 --> 01:25:32.000
Give me an abacus!

01:25:57.160 --> 01:26:00.000
Well, apart from spitting melted food in my face,

01:26:00.000 --> 01:26:03.200
