01:26:03.200 --> 01:26:11.200
Good. After a long day camping, it is good to relax with a nice song next to the bonfire.

01:26:11.200 --> 01:26:14.360
I call this the bonfire song.

01:26:14.360 --> 01:26:19.160
Let's get together and sing our song.

01:26:19.160 --> 01:26:23.850
The C-A-N-C-O-N of the bonfire.

01:26:23.850 --> 01:26:30.000
