01:28:13.980 --> 01:28:17.900
Maybe it's stupid, but it's also stupid!

01:28:17.900 --> 01:28:20.000
Patricio is right, squid.

01:28:20.000 --> 01:28:22.000
Sea bears are not a joke.

01:28:22.000 --> 01:28:30.000
Because once I met a guy who met a guy who met another who met another...

01:28:30.160 --> 01:28:34.620
who knew another, who knew another, who knew another, who knew another, who knew another...

01:28:34.620 --> 01:28:38.080
You're right! I must be more careful!

01:28:38.080 --> 01:28:44.530
Actually, why don't you tell me everything I shouldn't do if I want to get away from the seabirds?

01:28:44.530 --> 01:28:47.330
Well, it's easy. First of all, don't touch the clarinet.

01:28:47.330 --> 01:28:48.530
Well, what else?

01:28:48.530 --> 01:28:50.840
Don't move your flashlight backwards and forwards too fast.

01:28:50.840 --> 01:28:53.040
Flightlights are their natural prey.

01:28:53.040 --> 01:28:53.880
Are you kidding?

01:28:53.880 --> 01:28:55.920
Don't step on it too hard. They take it as a challenge.

01:28:55.920 --> 01:28:56.720
Yes.

01:28:56.720 --> 01:28:57.680
Go on.

01:28:57.680 --> 01:28:58.960
Never eat cheese.

01:28:58.960 --> 01:29:00.000
In slices or cubes.

01:29:00.000 --> 01:29:04.000
- In cubes, in slices, yes. - Yes, eh? Eh? Eh?

01:29:04.000 --> 01:29:06.000
- Don't wear Mexican hats. - Ridiculously.

01:29:06.000 --> 01:29:08.000
- Or clown shoes. - Or a Hawaiian scarf.

01:29:08.000 --> 01:29:10.000
- And never. - Never.

01:29:10.000 --> 01:29:11.000
- Never. - Never.

01:29:11.000 --> 01:29:13.960
- Do as a chimpanzee. - Do as a chimpanzee.

01:29:13.960 --> 01:29:17.820
It's amazing how many things can enrage a bear.

01:29:17.820 --> 01:29:19.820
- They're horrible. - And they're horrible.

01:29:19.820 --> 01:29:24.820
And suddenly I have the feeling that we're all in danger.

01:29:24.820 --> 01:29:26.820
- Why? - Why?

01:29:26.820 --> 01:29:30.000
- I don't know, it's a...

01:29:30.000 --> 01:29:32.020
Nothing!

01:29:32.020 --> 01:29:34.440
Uh, yes!

01:29:34.440 --> 01:29:36.440
Uh, uh, uh, uh, uh!

01:29:36.440 --> 01:29:41.470
Calamardo, please, no!

01:29:41.470 --> 01:29:43.470
SpongeBob, what are we going to do?

01:29:43.470 --> 01:29:45.470
Without a doubt, a sea bear will come to eat us!

01:29:45.470 --> 01:29:47.470
Don't worry, Patricio, I'll draw a circle

01:29:47.470 --> 01:29:49.470
of bears on the floor!

01:29:49.470 --> 01:29:51.470
Well thought!

01:29:51.470 --> 01:29:53.470
All the experts say it's the only defense

01:29:53.470 --> 01:29:55.520
against your attack!

01:29:55.520 --> 01:29:57.520
Ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah!

01:29:57.520 --> 01:30:00.000
You two are so naive, you see?

01:30:00.280 --> 01:30:03.680
I did everything that attracts seahorses and nothing happened.

01:30:03.680 --> 01:30:08.880
If seahorses really existed, why didn't any of them appear?

01:30:08.880 --> 01:30:12.380
Maybe because you don't use the hat in a ridiculous way.

01:30:12.380 --> 01:30:15.080
Oh, pfft. I'm sorry, I'm so dumb.

01:30:15.080 --> 01:30:17.600
Should I... use it like this, huh?

01:30:21.940 --> 01:30:24.260
No, like this.

01:30:37.610 --> 01:30:40.290
Mardo, are you okay?

01:30:40.290 --> 01:30:42.360
No!

01:30:42.360 --> 01:30:45.360
Mardo, jump inside our anti-monster circle before it comes back!

01:30:45.360 --> 01:30:48.360
Marine bears usually attack more than once!

01:30:48.360 --> 01:30:50.360
Are you crazy?

01:30:50.360 --> 01:30:53.360
A circle of earth won't stop that monster!

01:30:53.360 --> 01:30:55.360
I'm going to run out!

01:30:55.360 --> 01:30:56.440
No!

01:31:01.820 --> 01:31:03.820
Don't run! The bears hate that!

01:31:04.320 --> 01:31:09.820
Thank you for the information. I'll walk quietly home.

01:31:09.820 --> 01:31:10.820
No!

01:31:16.570 --> 01:31:21.150
That makes them more enraged than seeing you running.

01:31:21.150 --> 01:31:24.150
Well, then I'll have to...

01:31:24.640 --> 01:31:29.990
I should have told you I didn't win.

01:31:30.000 --> 01:31:32.360
I don't know, I think you just don't like him.

01:31:32.360 --> 01:31:39.090
Pretend you're someone else!

01:31:39.090 --> 01:31:41.090
Ten, draw the circle!

01:31:41.090 --> 01:31:43.090
Okay.

01:31:43.090 --> 01:31:46.980
That was an oval, it has to be a circle!

01:31:46.980 --> 01:31:53.760
Leave me alone!

01:32:11.710 --> 01:32:13.930
They saved my life, boys!

01:32:13.930 --> 01:32:15.360
Yes!

01:32:15.360 --> 01:32:19.580
Yes, I'm glad it was just a sea bear.

01:32:19.580 --> 01:32:22.260
This circle had never scared a sea rhinoceros.

01:32:22.260 --> 01:32:23.700
And what do they bring us?

01:32:23.700 --> 01:32:26.230
The sound of the attack of a sea bear.

01:32:26.230 --> 01:32:30.000
Thank goodness we all have our underwear.

01:32:30.000 --> 01:32:32.800
You're anti-rhinoceros, aren't you, squid?

01:32:32.800 --> 01:32:33.840
Uh-huh.

01:35:32.400 --> 01:35:33.040
Thank you.

01:37:03.130 --> 01:37:03.650
Thank you.
